ProvenanceFaultTree
Copyright 2026 Oliver Inderwildi

This product includes an independent re-implementation of fault tree analysis
procedures published by the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission in the Fault Tree
Handbook (NUREG-0492, 1981) by W. E. Vesely, F. F. Goldberg, N. H. Roberts and
D. F. Haasl, a public-domain U.S. federal work.

This product can write models in the Open-PSA Model Exchange Format for analysis
by SCRAM (https://github.com/rakhimov/scram, GPL-3.0, (c) Olzhas Rakhimov and
contributors). SCRAM is neither bundled nor linked; it is invoked, if installed,
as a separate program.

See ATTRIBUTION.md for the full credit statement.
